{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00103",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.61,
      "end_seconds": 3.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "Evening. Long day, I imagine. Sit down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 3.93,
      "end_seconds": 4.63,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Hello."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 5.83,
      "end_seconds": 10.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.82,
      "text": "Yeah, morning, doctor. I'll stay and fill in anything that's missed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 11.19,
      "end_seconds": 15.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "Please do. Extra information is always welcome. You came on your own today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 16.72,
      "end_seconds": 19.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Yes, I managed on my own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.92,
      "end_seconds": 22.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Go ahead, tell me what's happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.14,
      "end_seconds": 34.81,
      "duration_seconds": 10.67,
      "text": "Well, I've been passing out once last week, and I wanted to get it checked. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.31,
      "end_seconds": 42.41,
      "duration_seconds": 6.1,
      "text": "Is this recent, or has it been a while? These questions might sound routine, but they matter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.74,
      "end_seconds": 50.54,
      "duration_seconds": 7.8,
      "text": "It's been like this since last Tuesday. I'm not great at remembering details, so bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.72,
      "end_seconds": 54.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "How bad is it, would you say?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.28,
      "end_seconds": 56.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "Severe, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.1,
      "end_seconds": 60.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Has there been blurred vision beforehand too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.96,
      "end_seconds": 63.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "Yes, since yesterday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.94,
      "end_seconds": 67.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "Have you been feeling hot and sweaty before it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.63,
      "end_seconds": 77.22,
      "duration_seconds": 9.59,
      "text": "Yes, actually. Oh, um, as for feeling hot and sweaty before it, pretty severe, if I'm being honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.54,
      "end_seconds": 81.72,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any shaking or jerking or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.99,
      "end_seconds": 87.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.59,
      "text": "No shaking or jerking or chest pain, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.56,
      "end_seconds": 90.24,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "And palpitations, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.98,
      "end_seconds": 92.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "No palpitations, thank goodness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 93.6,
      "end_seconds": 99.4,
      "duration_seconds": 5.8,
      "text": "Actually, uh, doctor, I did notice palpitations. He doesn't always say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.32,
      "end_seconds": 105.98,
      "duration_seconds": 5.66,
      "text": "No, I don't think I did. Maybe a little, I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.41,
      "end_seconds": 115.07,
      "duration_seconds": 7.66,
      "text": "Alright, I'll note both what you've said and what you've noticed. Any confusion afterwards, loss of bladder control or tongue biting at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.47,
      "end_seconds": 121.6,
      "duration_seconds": 6.13,
      "text": "I haven't had confusion afterwards, loss of bladder control or tongue biting, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.51,
      "end_seconds": 125.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.09,
      "end_seconds": 129.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "I mean, no, that's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.18,
      "end_seconds": 136.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.02,
      "end_seconds": 139.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.34,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 140.34,
      "end_seconds": 149.91,
      "duration_seconds": 9.57,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Temperature 37.0, respiratory rate 18, blood pressure 112 over 69. Oxygen saturation is 98 percent, pulse 84."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.96,
      "end_seconds": 152.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "Okay, noted. Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.37,
      "end_seconds": 159.53,
      "duration_seconds": 5.16,
      "text": "Hmm, just my tonsils out, when I was a child."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.75,
      "end_seconds": 164.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.42,
      "end_seconds": 166.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Not that I know, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.35,
      "end_seconds": 171.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "Let's go through your medication. What are you taking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.26,
      "end_seconds": 175.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "Telmisartan, 40 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 177.03,
      "end_seconds": 181.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "Doctor, our chart from the last visit lists it as 80 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.39,
      "end_seconds": 185.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "Hm. Do you have the latest prescription with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 185.99,
      "end_seconds": 196.02,
      "duration_seconds": 10.03,
      "text": "Well, I don't think I have it with me. It's tamsulosin, 0.4 milligrams, at night. Uh, I'm on Asthalin inhaler, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 197.37,
      "end_seconds": 199.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Does anything run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.57,
      "end_seconds": 202.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "My father had kidney stones."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.87,
      "end_seconds": 219.07,
      "duration_seconds": 15.2,
      "text": "What I'm doing here is putting together three things: what you tell me, what I find when I examine you, and what the tests show. None of those alone is enough, which is why we sometimes need to wait for results before being certain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 223.27,
      "end_seconds": 226.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "I, I appreciate you explaining that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.58,
      "end_seconds": 229.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "Moving on to your background, any past medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.04,
      "end_seconds": 251.71,
      "duration_seconds": 20.67,
      "text": "Okay, so I have high blood pressure. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it. I have an enlarged prostate. Uh, you know, I have asthma. It's the not knowing that gets to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.03,
      "end_seconds": 264.03,
      "duration_seconds": 11.0,
      "text": "Okay, high blood pressure, that's already on your record. Good to know. Yes, I can see the an enlarged prostate in your file as well. Do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 264.47,
      "end_seconds": 266.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "I don't drink at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.3,
      "end_seconds": 270.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "How's everything else at home otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 271.7,
      "end_seconds": 278.68,
      "duration_seconds": 6.98,
      "text": "Busy. Everyone's running in different directions at the moment, you know how it is."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.36,
      "end_seconds": 282.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Okay, let's do a quick examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.76,
      "end_seconds": 285.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Let me check your reflexes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.62,
      "end_seconds": 306.75,
      "duration_seconds": 5.13,
      "text": "Your pulse is regular and there's a small bruise on the right side of the head."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.94,
      "end_seconds": 310.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "Now I'm going to check this part."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 324.0,
      "end_seconds": 325.51,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "No murmurs on listening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 328.3,
      "end_seconds": 347.75,
      "duration_seconds": 19.45,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Good, that's all I need to examine. Let me gather my thoughts and then we'll talk it through together. So, based on the history and the examination, I think we're dealing with a simple faint, probably reflex-related at this stage. I can't rule out dehydration yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 352.13,
      "end_seconds": 355.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "Uh, is this going to go away?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 357.14,
      "end_seconds": 373.45,
      "duration_seconds": 16.31,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now a simple faint, probably reflex-related is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've been passing out once last week, since last Tuesday, severe, and no shaking or jerking or loss of bladder control."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 374.62,
      "end_seconds": 377.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Yes, you know, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 378.34,
      "end_seconds": 380.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "We should do blood tests for syncope."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 381.88,
      "end_seconds": 386.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "Doctor, I did an ECG before they came in, the result's on your screen."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 387.89,
      "end_seconds": 406.68,
      "duration_seconds": 18.79,
      "text": "Okay, thanks, I'll look at that. Drink enough water and avoid standing still for long stretches, and sit if you feel it coming. Please take the tablets with food so they don't upset your stomach. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 407.65,
      "end_seconds": 409.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 409.35,
      "end_seconds": 418.94,
      "duration_seconds": 9.59,
      "text": "I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if you pass out again, especially with chest pain or palpitations. Let's review you in two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 420.48,
      "end_seconds": 425.82,
      "duration_seconds": 5.34,
      "text": "I mean, sure, I'll make the appointment on the way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 426.34,
      "end_seconds": 430.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "Okay, summarise it for me, what's the plan from your side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 431.14,
      "end_seconds": 435.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "So, I come back in two weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 437.08,
      "end_seconds": 442.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.96,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. We're all set. Don't leave without asking if something's unclear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 442.99,
      "end_seconds": 445.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "Hmm, I appreciate your time, doctor."
    }
  ]
}